# Check everything out with LF line endings, on Windows too: the course image is Linux, and
# CRLF breaks it (e.g. the Dockerfile reads lean-toolchain as "v4.3.0\r").
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.olean binary
